{"author": "raymond91125", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0003400 regulation of COPII vesicle coating\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/31945\n\nReplaced by GO:0048208 COPII vesicle coating\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1laqfstDFialSU27NtY9cCijhpmi5kDDUvZLgo_pqUyE\n\nImpacted groups: \n~SGD 8~\nUniProt 3\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \nGO:0003400\tunirule2go\tUniRule:UR001628761 > GO:regulation of COPII vesicle coating ; GO:0003400\n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2026-04-22T22:55:54Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to GO:0003400 regulation of COPII vesicle coating", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-05-29T20:26:17Z"}
